    <name>coffee_nonforest_control</name>
    <description>Manual reference AOI, not a surveyed farm boundary. Reference contains other land cover without afforestation and no mapped first deforestation year. Do not infer forest conversion from seasonal crop/pasture NDVI variation; current commodity use and absence of all change are not independently verified. PLUTo sample 190000284 (coffee); https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17831353, CC-BY-4.0. Geometry derived from European Commission JRC TMF v1_1982_2025. See manifest.json and README.md for source dates, attribution and limitations.</description>
